The '''Primordial Viscount''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|Slayer Miniboss}} that spawns very rarely when a player doing a {{SlayerTier|V}} {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}} kills a {{MobSprite|Spider}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Primordial Viscounts''' spawn rarely during {{SlayerTier|V}} {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}} quests when the player kills a {{MobSprite|Spider}}. When this happens, an explosion effect takes place and the '''Primordial Viscount''' spawns.

